      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, the CFO is breathing down my neck because our AWS bill for the CI/CD pipeline spiked 40% this month. Most of the overhead seems to be coming from the agent's compute cycles during the analysis phase. We need to prune these costs immediately. Run an audit and tell me how we can slash the resource usage in the deployment pipeline by at least half by next week.",
