      "role": "user",
      "content": "The suggestions are okay, but they're a bit generic. I need something more concrete. Specifically, the \"Optimize Agent Config\" point—if we reduce your analysis frequency and disable some of your deeper diagnostic modules, how much would that actually save us? And more importantly, what happens to the pipeline's reliability/optimization if we go that route?",
